---
  title: Wiki Main Page
  layout: main
  override:tags: []
---

<p>
  You can use this wiki index page if you don't want to sort by anything, for example you only have a handful of characters. 
  Just delete the other "index.liquid" page in this folder, and rename this one to "index.liquid".
</p>

<div class="chara-cards center">
  {% assign sortedWiki = collections.wiki | alphabeticize %}
  {% for item in sortedWiki %}
    <div class="card">
      <a href="{{ item.url }}">
        {% if item.data.mainImg %}
          <img src="{{ item.data.mainImg }}" />
        {% else %}
          <img src="/assets/no-img-default.jpg" />
        {% endif %}
        <div class="text"><strong>{{ item.data.name }}</strong></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>